# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# Virtual environments. qiskit_hw/ is the second, Qiskit 2.x environment used
# only for real-device submission; see README section 2.1.
qiskit_hw/
.venv*/
venv/
env/

# Editor and tool caches
.vscode/
.pytest_cache/

# Bulk results, excluded by kind and never by directory: git does not descend
# into an excluded directory, so a negation beneath one could never match. The
# per-solution fields live in the Zenodo deposit named in results/README.md and
# the figures regenerate from the archives. The two negations keep what the
# dissertation's numbers actually rest on.
*.npz
!results/qsvt_phase_cache/*.npz
*.csv
!results/**/*.csv
*.png
*.jpg
*.pdf
*.xlsx

# Cluster logs. The few worth keeping are committed gzipped, which these
# patterns do not match.
*.log
*.err
*.out

# Supervisor meeting material, not part of the record
results/meetings/
